{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And they bore.</b> It is not said about Avimelech but about his wife and his mothers. Analogy: ויחמו הצאן (and the flock conceived). And proof for the matter: כי עצר עצר בעד כל רחם לבית אבימלך — analogy: תנה את נשי ואת ילדי אשר עבדתי אותך בהן, where עבדתי אותך בהן does not refer to them but to אנשי."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:04.814891302Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}